{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36184","headline":"题长洲陈明府小亭 · 方干","name":"题长洲陈明府小亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐看孤峭却劳神，还是微吟到日曛。\n松鹤认名呼得下，沙蝉飞处听犹闻。\n夜阑亦似深山月，雨後唯关满屋云。\n便此逍遥应不易，朱衣红斾未容君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}